WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA<br>
<br>
 DIN DHALA ASR KA JAB SHAAM HUI,<br>
 KYA UDAASI THI HARAM PAR CHAAYI,<br>
 BHAIYI KI LAASH PA ZAINAB NE KAHA,<br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA <br>
<br>
<br>
AB NA QASIM NA ALI AKBAR,<br>
 AB NA ABBAS NA AB ASGHAR HAI,<br>
 NA RAHA KOI BHI ABID KE SIWA,<br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA<br>
<br>
ROKE ZINDAAN MEIN SAKINA NE KAHA,<br>
 DAM GHOOTA JATA AOO BABA,<br>
 KYON NAHI SUNTE HO TUM MERI SADA,<br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA<br>
<br>
BHAYI BE GORO KAFAN MAQTAL MEIN,<br>
 BE RIDE SHEH KI BAHEN MAQTAL MEIN,<br>
 CHEENLI SHUMRE SITAMGAR NE RIDA,<br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA<br>
<br>
HURMULA TU NE AJAB KI HAI JAFA,<br>
 HAYE WO TEER WO ASGHAR KA GALA,<br>
 INTEHA YE HAI KE JHOOLA BHI JALA,<br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA<br>
<br>
ZULM YE ABID-E-MUZTAR PA HUA,<br>
TAOQ GARDAN MAIN WO DURRO KI JAFA,<br>
 THA MAGAR LAB FAQAT SHUKRE KHUDA <br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA<br>
<br>
LEKE PARWANA E QASIM PARCHAM,<br>
 QULD MEIN JAYENGE KARTE MATAM,<br>
 AUR ANKHON MEIN LIYE ASHKE AZA<br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA<br>
<br>
HAYE YE KAISI UDAASI HAI SOHAIL,<br>
 AANKH FITRAT KI BHARI AYI HAI SOHAIL,<br>
 HAYE KYA AAP NE NOUHA YE LIKHA,<br>
 WA HUSSAINA SHAHEEDE KARBALA..